id=cleanboot
name=Clean Boot
version=v1.1
versionCode=2
author=dmk
description=Once after boot: removes sys.oem_unlock_allowed (doesn't exist on a stock Xiaomi, so detectors flag it) and hides the two vendor SELinux files that name LineageOS. Stops Sui's debug logger (a logcat copying every log line to a file). Then exits.
